# Sources of the hash-measurement study (hub 3.15). Old-body files the study cites are already source nodes 2.1.6, 2.1.7, 2.1.9 and 2.1.11; line ranges sit in the citing claim.

n: 2.23
name: hash-measurement-sources
kind: hub
is: The primary sources behind hub 3.15: the study report that measured digest and store cost on one machine, five first-round reports the study answers or quotes, and the installed JavaScript BLAKE3 module used as an independent check. The study's own programs and raw outputs sit outside every repository and are cited through the report.
